  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.PocketBaseOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to PocketBase via its REST API. PocketBase is a self-hosted, single-file open-source backend with realtime subscriptions, authentication, and file storage. No PocketBase SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- fix: complete PocketBase page reads and modern superuser authentication (f112215)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Recover PocketBase CQL demo and uncertain-write reconciliation tests (c3f05ec)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Cloud/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.PocketBaseOASIS",
